rd at Blackwood Loch. Go ahead and take a look.","jp":"グラナディラ湖にある伐採場に木材がたくさんある。見に行ってみよう。","kr":"블랙우드 호수에 있는 블러디 로즈의 벌목장에 목재가 많이 있다. 가서 확인해 보자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"去绿蚀道","en":"Visit Eroded Tunnel","jp":"緑蝕の路へ向かう","kr":"침식의 터널로 가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"木材到手，去绿蚀道找泥浆吧。","en":"Now, head to the Eroded Tunnel to gather some mud.","jp":"木材を手に入れたら、緑蝕の路へ向かって粘土を探そう。","kr":"목재를 모았다. 이제 침식의 터널에서 진흙을 찾아보자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"击败腐臭泥","en":"Defeat Plaguerot","jp":"腐臭ドロを倒す","kr":"역병 진흙 처치하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"眼前忽然冒出一只臭臭的还在淌泥的怪物，打败它。","en":"A stinky monster dripping mud appears out of nowhere. Defeat it.","jp":"いきなり目の前に腐臭を放つ泥のモンスターが現れたので、戦って打ち負かそう。","kr":"진흙 속에서 역겨운 몬스터가 튀어나왔다. 처치하자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"调制补墙剂","en":"Prepare Wall Plaster","jp":"補修材を作る","kr":"수리제 만들기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"木材和泥浆收集完毕，可以调制补墙剂了。","en":"With the wood and mud in place, you can prepare the wall plaster now.","jp":"集めた木材と粘土を用いて、補修材を作ろう。","kr":"목재와 진흙을 다 모았다. 이제 수리제를 만들 수 있을 것이다."}},{"step_id":"7","pre_step_ids":["6"],"objective_title":{"cn":"和阿尔交谈","en":"Talk to Al","jp":"アルと話す","kr":"아르와 대화하기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"把补墙剂给水鬼阿尔吧。","en":"Hand the wall plaster over to Al.","jp":"完成した補修材をアルに渡そう。","kr":"수리제를 아르에게 전하기"}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"12236080","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12236080","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12236080.asset","raw_sha256":"918445b810465efb490b6f41e4945e3e45f5a1982a091f524ecbc5fd37d9bdd4","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":9810544,"size":1640,"identity":"12010522:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"12236090","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12236090","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12236090.asset","